  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NToba Horticulture Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to improve the groups one hectare plot by installing a new irrigation system and fencing it to protect it from roaming animals. The Cooperative will also construct three wells that will provide a reliable and constant source of water to the production perimeter.</narrative>
  </description>
